#                            one reader losing nothing a ring kept; every handled trap in a64x_emulate_user is noted
#   xnu_sched_systime_test   kernel/switch/sched/systime.h: user threads' kernel time by what entered the kernel and its
#                            line; both trees' sleh_synchronous count each entry and recount hands over each slice,
